text: |-
  Shawn Ryan
  @ShawnRyan762
  ...
  This was a message exchanged between Charlie Kirk's head of security
  and the UVU chief of police regarding the rooftop. Join me LIVE tonight
  on Vigilance Elite Patreon for a complete breakdown of the tragic events
  that led up to-and followed-the shooting that claimed the life of
  Charlie Kirk.
  srs.site/EARLY-ACCESS
  Text Message • RCS
  Monday 4:11PM
  Hello Chief Long - We received this
  message today from the student
  group.
  FYSA
  "there is student roof access pretty
  close to where CK will be set up at
  Utah Valley (The Sorensen Student
  center has a couple stair cases that go
  up to the walkways on the roof"
  You want access to the roof?
  I was told students have access above
  us, if this is true, it would be nice to
  either have it controlled access or
  allow one of my guys to be there as
  well. If possible.
  I got you covered
  Monday 8:29 PM
  Thank you, Sir.
